  "id": "cognitive-construct",
  "term": "cognitive construct",
  "definition": "A cognitive construct is a psychological characteristic related to mental ability. In measurement research, cognitive constructs are commonly treated as ability-based traits where higher levels of the underlying trait are expected to go with a greater likelihood of a given response.",
